    "Test volume for %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@的测试音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test your current delays, or use a wired microphone to measure both outputs. Nothing changes until you apply a result.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试听当前延迟，或用有线麦克风测量两个输出。应用结果前，现有设置保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The measured difference is outside the supported 0–2000 ms compensation range.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测量结果超出 0–2000 ms 的补偿范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is used only during calibration. Recordings stay in memory and are discarded afterward.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在校准期间使用麦克风。录音只在内存中分析，结束后丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone recording clipped. Lower the output volume or move the microphone farther away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风录音出现削波。请降低播放音量，或将麦克风稍微移远后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system disabled FineTune's event tap — usually after a sleep/wake cycle or a main-thread stall. Retry to reinstall it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统已停用 FineTune 的按键监听，通常发生在睡眠唤醒之后。点击重试即可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test audio source could not start. Check audio capture permission and reconnect the selected devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启动测试音源。请检查系统音频录制权限，并重新连接所选设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test sound was too quiet. Move the AirPods sound outlet closer to the selected microphone, check both output volumes, and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未清楚测到测试音。请将 AirPods 发声口靠近所选麦克风，检查两个输出的音量后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device needs too much delay-buffer memory. Disable compensation for this route.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备的延迟缓冲需要过多内存，请关闭此路由的延迟补偿。"
          }
        }
